{"id":"5a99f1813d80f3c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-analytic-determinacy.md","title":"Analytic Determinacy","display":"thm-analytic-determinacy — Analytic Determinacy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-analytic-determinacy","aliases":["58-thm-analytic-determinacy"],"display":"thm-analytic-determinacy — Analytic Determinacy","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-analytic-determinacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-analytic-determinacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytic-determinacy — Analytic Determinacy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq \\omega^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq \\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (payoff set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\)</span> (analytic-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\)</span> (three-place determined-game predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> (measurable-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\left(\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\right)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\to \\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\left(\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\right)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\to \\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A,\\omega)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Martin's measurable-cardinal theorem supplies the displayed sufficient hypothesis; analytic determinacy is not asserted here as a theorem of ZFC alone.  The conclusion supplies the full play tree and move set required by the registered three-place game predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}